_38\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 38\">38</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_39\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 39\">39</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_40\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 40\">40</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_41\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 41\">41</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_42\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 42\">42</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_43\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 43\">43</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_44\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 44\">44</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_45\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 45\">45</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_46\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 46\">46</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_47\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 47\">47</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_48\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 48\">48</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_49\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 49\">49</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_50\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 50\">50</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_51\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 51\">51</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_52\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 52\">52</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_53\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 53\">53</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_54\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 54\">5